WEBVTT

00:16.500 --> 00:18.460
<i>I am a cat.</i>

00:19.580 --> 00:21.620
<i>I may be tooting my own horn,</i>

00:22.230 --> 00:24.940
<i>but I consider myself to be 
quite a masterful cat.</i>

00:27.160 --> 00:30.440
<i>Even one such as I
has pressing concerns.</i>

00:32.520 --> 00:33.470
<i>It's that...</i>

00:36.640 --> 00:42.890
My owner 
(a 27-year-old
 woman)...

00:36.790 --> 00:42.160
<i>My owner still hasn't learned 
how to separate the trash!</i>

00:38.180 --> 00:42.890
...still hasn't learned how 
to separate the trash!

00:42.930 --> 00:43.020
<b>Stupid</b>

00:43.020 --> 00:43.100
<b>Stupid</b>

00:43.100 --> 00:45.060
<b>Stupid</b>

00:43.640 --> 00:44.020
<b>Birdbrain</b>

00:44.020 --> 00:44.100
<b>Birdbrain</b>

00:44.100 --> 00:45.060
<b>Birdbrain</b>

00:46.190 --> 00:48.440
<i>I found plastic trash 
with the burnable trash!</i>

00:49.200 --> 00:51.360
<i>She moved plastic trash 
into the PET bottle trash!</i>

00:54.360 --> 01:01.330
A cat who reseparates
 the trash right before
 taking it out.

00:57.570 --> 01:00.390
<i>Why, Homo sapiens?!</i>

01:02.280 --> 01:06.750
<i>How in the world do the neighborhood 
crows know how the trash is separated</i>

01:07.560 --> 01:10.750
<i>and what day they're put 
out better than her?!</i>

01:11.550 --> 01:14.760
<b>Burnable Trash</b>

01:12.550 --> 01:14.760
<b>Plastic Trash</b>

01:13.460 --> 01:14.760
<b>PET Bottles</b>

01:20.260 --> 01:22.010
<i>Goodness.</i>

01:22.470 --> 01:26.930
<i>I can't believe a company 
hired such a worthless human.</i>

01:28.320 --> 01:33.220
<i>If she loses her job, I should 
immediately give up on her and leave.</i>

01:35.930 --> 01:39.160
Y-Yukichi!

01:39.160 --> 01:42.120
Did you change the recipe 
for the hamburg steak sauce?!

01:42.120 --> 01:43.740
You're a genius!

01:43.740 --> 01:45.910
It's so freaking delicious!

01:46.620 --> 01:48.330
What the hell is this?!

01:49.550 --> 01:51.460
You've got to make this again!

01:58.900 --> 02:01.450
This is happiness!

02:17.900 --> 02:24.950
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

03:31.980 --> 03:35.650
Can

03:31.980 --> 03:35.650
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Good at Giving Care</b>

03:35.770 --> 03:36.980
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Good at Giving Care</b>

03:35.860 --> 03:36.980
Can

03:36.980 --> 03:40.070
<i>...will soon be arriving on platform two.</i>

03:51.730 --> 03:53.230
Good morning.

03:54.910 --> 03:56.150
Be safe!

03:56.150 --> 03:57.590
Hello!

04:19.720 --> 04:21.600
Hey, Yukichi.

04:23.540 --> 04:27.990
It might sound kind of weird 
asking you this, but...

04:29.820 --> 04:31.250
Please!

04:32.080 --> 04:35.540
I want you to teach me how to cook.

04:36.940 --> 04:40.590
I got myself an apron 
and prepared some tools.

04:50.470 --> 04:53.710
Please! Please, Teacher!

04:53.710 --> 04:59.270
I don't want to grow old only
 knowing how to make cup ramen!

04:59.270 --> 05:01.940
I remembered last week!

05:01.940 --> 05:09.420
I'm a worthless human being that can't even 
take care of myself without you, Yukichi!

05:10.410 --> 05:12.290
The place last week

05:13.080 --> 05:18.290
Just remembered

05:16.270 --> 05:17.560
On top of that...

05:18.760 --> 05:20.470
The people at my company 
are starting to think

05:20.470 --> 05:24.300
that I'm the type of woman 
that's good at cooking.

05:24.780 --> 05:27.580
Wow! Fukuzawa-san can even bake sweets?

05:28.200 --> 05:29.720
Such strong home-making skills!

05:30.040 --> 05:31.890
Fukuzawa, you always bring your lunch, too.

05:31.890 --> 05:33.430
You'll make a great wife.

05:34.470 --> 05:35.680
I really can't cook at all!

05:35.680 --> 05:39.220
If you consider yourself a bad cook, 
the rest of us are completely worthless.

05:37.160 --> 05:38.650
So good...

05:39.220 --> 05:40.810
Senpai! Please become my wife!

05:40.810 --> 05:41.820
No, no, no, no.

05:42.170 --> 05:45.590
I want to close the gap between 
fact and fiction as much as I can

05:45.590 --> 05:48.050
before anyone finds out!

05:49.670 --> 05:51.280
And, so!

05:51.910 --> 05:56.150
I want to become skilled enough 
to make my own lunches!

05:57.290 --> 05:59.460
<b>Homemade Food Even Monkeys Can Make</b>

05:58.040 --> 05:59.750
Please take care of me!

06:02.380 --> 06:06.550
But I really need to start 
with something super simple.

06:07.800 --> 06:13.060
<b>Plain TKG (Tamago-Kake-Gohan)
 A simple bowl of rice with raw egg.

[How to Make]
 1: Crack a raw egg over a bowl of rice.
 2: Drizzle soy sauce over it.
 3: Add topping.</b>

06:07.800 --> 06:13.060
<b>Rice Balls
 Soul Food

 [How to Make]
 1: Spread rice on some plastic wrap.
 2: Place filling in the center.
 (Don't overfill!)
 3: Gather the plastic wrap like a drawstring purse
 and shape the rice ball in your hands.
 4: Wrap with seaweed.</b>

06:10.840 --> 06:13.060
Plain rice
 with raw egg.

06:11.540 --> 06:13.060
Huh? This?!

06:15.240 --> 06:17.560
Isn't this a bit hard?

06:17.940 --> 06:20.390
I have to crack an egg, right?

06:25.700 --> 06:27.510
No! No! I'm kidding!

06:27.510 --> 06:29.860
No way. No way.

06:29.860 --> 06:34.580
Even I can crack an egg! Bring it on!

06:39.000 --> 06:40.920
Okay! I have an egg!

06:51.220 --> 06:52.080
Now what?!

06:58.730 --> 07:01.650
Crack a raw
 egg over a
 bowl of rice.

07:01.730 --> 07:04.650
Drizzle soy
 sauce over it.

07:04.730 --> 07:07.650
Add
topping.

07:08.440 --> 07:09.900
Hold on!

07:11.130 --> 07:13.690
That's the only explanation 
they have for step one?!

07:14.700 --> 07:16.800
How do I crack an egg?!

07:16.450 --> 07:19.200
Crack a raw
 egg over a
 bowl of rice.

07:16.800 --> 07:20.340
How is this something 
even monkeys can make?!

07:20.040 --> 07:21.210
<b>Crack</b>

07:45.750 --> 07:48.480
Tiny shell bits are all 
over it like a topping!

07:49.190 --> 07:51.980
A-A little calcium never hurts.

07:51.980 --> 07:57.310
No, wait. Egg shells are dangerous 
because of salmo-something right?

08:01.260 --> 08:02.100
Huh?

08:06.070 --> 08:07.670
Yukichi, you're amazing!

08:07.670 --> 08:09.920
You can hold chopsticks 
so well with those paws.

08:13.140 --> 08:14.760
How're you doing that?

08:17.750 --> 08:19.090
It's done!

08:19.090 --> 08:21.730
Plain raw egg over rice!

08:22.100 --> 08:24.290
Amazing! It's the real thing!

08:22.100 --> 08:29.860
<b>Glowing</b>

08:24.640 --> 08:27.360
This is the first time I've made 
something other than cup ramen!

08:27.150 --> 08:29.860
Eyes filled with pity

08:32.910 --> 08:33.990
It looks so good!

08:40.330 --> 08:43.000
<b>Drip...</b>

09:00.390 --> 09:01.270
Something...

09:01.810 --> 09:05.010
Isn't there something easier than this?!

09:05.010 --> 09:08.710
Something where I don't need to 
crack eggs or pour soy sauce?

09:12.200 --> 09:16.570
Come to think of it, did we 
always have a cookbook like this?

09:16.570 --> 09:20.080
<b>Hamburg Steak</b>

09:17.130 --> 09:20.090
I never bought something like this.

09:20.440 --> 09:23.650
And you cook without looking at recipes, Yukichi...

09:26.060 --> 09:32.580
But I feel like I've eaten 
everything in this book before.

09:38.360 --> 09:42.740
Isn't this all the food you used to make 
for me when you were a kitten?!

09:50.480 --> 09:51.940
Why'd you hide?

09:52.880 --> 09:55.190
It's nothing to be embarrassed about!

09:56.330 --> 09:58.060
How nostalgic!

09:58.060 --> 10:02.870
I completely forgot about it since you 
started cooking like a pro so quickly!

10:04.530 --> 10:08.500
You looked at every one of these 
recipes and cooked them one by one.

10:09.480 --> 10:11.110
Hey, Yukichi!

10:12.220 --> 10:15.920
I want to eat this again!

10:16.570 --> 10:20.190
Rice balls were the first things 
you ever made for me!

10:32.200 --> 10:33.940
They look so good!

10:34.870 --> 10:37.900
You're so good at making 
triangles with those paws.

10:37.900 --> 10:39.460
How're you doing that?

10:41.440 --> 10:47.210
<i>Afterwards, Yukichi turned the failed 
raw egg over rice into rice porridge.</i>

11:29.870 --> 11:30.540
<b>Crack</b>

11:58.980 --> 12:00.770
Hey, Yukichi.

12:00.770 --> 12:05.370
How do I stop my smartphone 
alarm from snoozing?

12:06.900 --> 12:09.680
Whoa! S-Sorry! Are you okay?!

12:14.000 --> 12:15.560
I'm off!

12:34.060 --> 12:36.770
Tissues 
were left
 in the
 laundry

12:41.280 --> 12:46.660
Shaking towels vigorously
 before hanging them to dry
 makes the pile in the 
fabric stand up,
 making them fluffier.

12:51.660 --> 12:53.410
Refreshed.

13:14.600 --> 13:17.560
Rewashing

13:34.000 --> 13:35.960
<b>Account
 Book</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:35.960
<b>Churu</b>

13:44.760 --> 13:46.970
A cat who regains 
his peace by looking 
at the amount saved
 in their family bank
 account

13:47.670 --> 13:53.510
<i>Currently, we are having 
a completely unexpected rainstorm.</i>

13:53.910 --> 13:57.060
<i>We suspect the rain clouds 
will continue to grow,</i>

13:57.060 --> 14:00.350
<i>causing even heavier rain into the night.</i>

14:00.350 --> 14:03.110
<i>A landslide advisory is currently in effect.</i>

14:03.960 --> 14:06.110
Excuse me! Sorry for bothering you.

14:06.690 --> 14:09.870
<i>Do you always have that 
folding umbrella with you?</i>

14:09.870 --> 14:11.530
Oh, yes!

14:11.530 --> 14:14.630
I got into trouble buying them from 
convenience stores all the time,

14:14.630 --> 14:16.090
so now it's always packed for me.

14:16.090 --> 14:19.700
<i>True, it's quite easy to build up 
too many convenience store umbrellas!</i>

14:19.700 --> 14:20.880
<i>I agree!</i>

14:20.880 --> 14:24.790
Thank goodness you have someone at home 
who packs a folding umbrella for you.

14:25.680 --> 14:30.160
<i>Y-Yes, you're right. 
I'm always thankful to have him.</i>

14:31.530 --> 14:35.060
<i>The rain will continue to 
get worse, so please be careful.</i>

14:35.060 --> 14:37.560
<i>Thank you for your time!</i>

14:38.350 --> 14:41.930
Now, stay tuned for our 
next popular segment!

14:46.700 --> 14:48.700
Yukichi, I'm home.

14:52.730 --> 14:56.950
Wh-What's going on?! Dinner looks
 so extravagant today!

14:57.490 --> 15:01.710
It looks great! Did something good happen?

15:02.530 --> 15:06.960
Wait, premium beer, too?!

15:06.960 --> 15:09.320
Are you sure? Is it going to 
rain again tomorrow?!

15:09.320 --> 15:11.620
No way!

15:16.600 --> 15:18.420
Cheers!

15:23.140 --> 15:25.040
The rain this morning was crazy!

15:59.170 --> 16:00.550
Yukichi!

16:03.510 --> 16:05.230
I bought something good today!

16:05.230 --> 16:07.480
<b>Catnip Mini Sticks</b>

16:07.480 --> 16:10.490
<b>Rolling Meow~</b>

16:21.660 --> 16:23.120
This is
 <b>catnip</b>

16:23.510 --> 16:26.330
Hey, watch how you hold it! Watch it!

16:31.320 --> 16:32.490
Good morning.

16:32.490 --> 16:33.130
Oh, hello.

16:38.260 --> 16:41.430
<i>It is almost 6:50 in the morning.</i>

16:41.900 --> 16:45.870
<i>Today's weather will be sunny 
throughout the whole country.</i>

16:45.870 --> 16:47.640
<i>It is the perfect day to do laundry.</i>

16:47.150 --> 16:51.650
Before 7 AM

16:48.030 --> 16:51.220
<i>Please use the sun efficiently today!</i>

16:49.400 --> 16:51.650
Year-round late sleeper &
 habitually guilty of falling asleep again

16:53.280 --> 16:55.290
G-Good morning.

17:00.420 --> 17:03.680
<i>Starting tomorrow, there will be 
a drop in barometric pressure</i>

17:03.680 --> 17:06.120
<i>which will bring cooler temperatures.</i>

17:06.120 --> 17:08.380
<i>Please make sure to 
carry outerwear with you.</i>

17:09.550 --> 17:13.340
N-No way! I don't have a fever!

17:13.340 --> 17:16.650
I just happened to wake up 
early today. How rude...

17:20.330 --> 17:22.070
H-Huh?

17:22.880 --> 17:28.150
That's weird. Maybe it's broken?

17:28.150 --> 17:30.360
I don't feel...

17:30.360 --> 17:32.650
<b>Just take
 a sick day
 aura</b>

17:34.610 --> 17:37.120
No, no! Today's important!

17:37.120 --> 17:38.810
Hey!

17:41.020 --> 17:43.520
P-Please...

17:44.390 --> 17:48.700
I... I really can't take today off!

17:50.510 --> 17:54.670
I have three meetings 
first thing in the morning!

17:54.670 --> 18:01.010
It's fine! It's not bad enough that 
I need to rest on such an important day!

18:04.110 --> 18:08.690
I mean, normally, I would 
totally want to take a day off!

18:09.080 --> 18:12.670
But I have some self-awareness 
as a working adult.

18:21.120 --> 18:23.700
Cold! Cold! Cold!

18:23.700 --> 18:27.710
Cold! Cold! Cold!

18:30.270 --> 18:34.810
Ah, Chief, good morning. It's Fukuzawa.

18:34.210 --> 18:40.220
<b>Cold Medicine</b>

18:34.210 --> 18:40.220
<b>fever • cough • throat pain</b>

18:35.430 --> 18:38.440
Yes. Yes. I'm sorry.

18:38.440 --> 18:40.220
Please take care of things.

18:46.130 --> 18:48.470
I got half the day off.

18:49.440 --> 18:53.480
It can't be helped. 
Don't click your tongue at me.

18:54.470 --> 18:56.940
I have to bring down the 
fever by this afternoon.

18:57.330 --> 19:00.580
Sweat... I need to sweat it out.

19:09.390 --> 19:13.590
I'll eat super spicy food 
and take a hot bath.

19:15.040 --> 19:18.250
Don't stop me, Yukichi!

19:16.630 --> 19:19.590
Such actions will cause exhaustion
 and be counterproductive

19:40.160 --> 19:42.070
Yukichi...

19:44.340 --> 19:47.610
Yukichi, where are you?

19:47.610 --> 19:50.130
I bought some canned cat food!

19:51.020 --> 19:55.290
I'll definitely try my 
best at work this time.

19:56.340 --> 20:00.000
I'll buy you tons of canned cat food...

20:15.440 --> 20:18.440
<i>Please stand behind the yellow line.</i>

20:59.300 --> 21:01.270
Shoot, what time is it?

21:01.270 --> 21:03.400
I have to go to work.

21:08.940 --> 21:12.890
I think my fever has gone down a lot.

21:18.150 --> 21:21.340
But I'm still a little tired.

21:30.050 --> 21:33.260
<i>In the end, I got the whole day off.</i>

23:06.900 --> 23:31.930
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:07.430 --> 23:10.030
<i>I am a masterful cat.</i>

23:10.520 --> 23:12.450
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

23:12.450 --> 23:17.730
<i>Sea slugs are a type of marine gastropod 
mollusk that evolved to lose their shells.</i>

23:17.730 --> 23:20.390
<i>In other words, they are 
in the same family as snails.</i>

23:20.830 --> 23:22.960
<i>The appendages on their head 
look like little horns,</i>

23:22.960 --> 23:24.920
<i>so they are commonly called 
"cows of the sea" in Japan.</i>

23:24.920 --> 23:28.930
<i>These sea slugs are the inspiration 
for the sea slug idol group, UMYU-Sea...</i>

23:28.930 --> 23:30.530
<i>Out of time?</i>

23:31.140 --> 23:34.750
<i>Next episode: "A Masterful 
Cat Goes to the Aquarium."</i>

23:31.930 --> 23:36.930
Can

23:31.930 --> 23:36.930
<b>A Masterful Cat Goes to the Aquarium</b>

23:34.750 --> 23:36.210
<i>I cannot wait.</i>
